</TABLE> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B><U>Dana to Host Conference Call at 9 a.m. Wednesday, October&nbsp;28 </U></B></P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B>Dana will discuss its third-quarter 2026 results in a conference call at 9 a.m. EDT on Wednesday, October 28. The conference call can be accessed by
telephone from both domestic and international locations using the information provided below: </B></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B>Conference ID: 596 110 089 </B></P>
