<HR SIZE="3" style="COLOR:#999999" WIDTH="100%" ALIGN="CENTER"> <p style="margin-bottom:0pt" align="center">
<img src="g160614ex99_1s23g1.jpg" alt="Slide 23" title="Slide 23" ></p> <p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:1pt;line-height:0pt;color:#FFFFFF;"><font style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:1pt;"> Solid third-quarter results driven
by productivity gains and commercial actions Business Overview Eaton Mobility Transaction on Track and Pre-Closing Share Repurchases Increased See "Disclaimers" for comments regarding the presentation of non-GAAP measures Operating performance $2B
Sales +$121M vs. Q3 2025 $218M Adjusted EBITDA 10.7% EBITDA margin +220 basis points vs. Q3 2025 Cost savings On track to achieve target by year end $320M Realized program-to-date $60M Realized year-to-date $325M Program target to be realized in Q4
Share repurchases Increased to $469M in 2026 Third Quarter $200M Returned to shareholders ~6.6M shares repurchased Year-to-Date $369M Returned to shareholders ~$100M more planned in 2026 Program-to-Date $1,020M Returned to shareholders $2B
authorization completion accelerated to mid-2029 +$56M vs. Q3 2025 Continuing to offset ~$40M of stranded costs from the Off-Highway sale Program active until Eaton Mobility transaction closes around the end of Q1 2027</font></p>
